### Listar
GET http://localhost:8080/pratos
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/pratos
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"nome": "Lasanha", "descricao": "Massa com molho e queijo", "preco": 35.0}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/pratos/1

### Filtrar
GET http://localhost:8080/pratos?nome=lasan

### Atualizar (todos os campos)
PUT http://localhost:8080/pratos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome": "Lasanha Atualizado", "descricao": "Massa com molho e queijo", "preco": 35.0}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:8080/pratos/1

### Inválido: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/pratos
Content-Type: application/json

{}
